<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Dental restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Dental restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it restarted United Dental Care with a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Ellie Kerns was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/16 at 29-1/2 on low volume late Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
